<div class="post-header">
  <h1 class="post-title">RPG Maker 事件 GIF 示例</h1>
  <div class="post-meta">
    <span><svg width="13" height="13" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"/><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"/></svg> 2026年3月20日</span>
    <span><svg width="13" height="13" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg> 约 1 分钟阅读</span>
